# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development. `.dev.vars` is gitignored and the
# Cloudflare Vite plugin / `wrangler dev` read it. Never commit real values.
#
# REQUIRED: base64-encoded 32-byte AES-GCM key used to encrypt user-supplied
# Scrape Credentials at rest. Generate one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
# In production set it with: wrangler secret put CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY
CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
